     "src": "/gcdn/authoring/authoring-images/2025/09/30/PDTF/86437692007-getty-images-1468259122.jpg?crop=4002,4001,x999,y0&amp;width=72&amp;height=72&amp;format=pjpg&amp;auto=webp"
