     "src": "/gcdn/authoring/authoring-images/2026/08/06/PDTF/91197162007-lo-hud-ibs-article-getty-images-1439682718.jpg?crop=4014,4012,x1002,y0&amp;width=72&amp;height=72&amp;format=pjpg&amp;auto=webp"
